1
00:00:00,638 --> 00:00:04,538
(Penny:)I'll come up with something
mushy, you'll cry, we got this.

2
00:00:04,608 --> 00:00:07,348
"Penny, we are
made of particles

3
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:09,710
"that have existed since the
moment the universe began.

4
00:00:09,779 --> 00:00:12,549
"I like to think
those atoms traveled

5
00:00:12,615 --> 00:00:15,615
"14 billion years through
time and space to create us,

6
00:00:15,685 --> 00:00:19,625
(Leonard:)so that we could be together
and make each other whole."

7
00:00:19,689 --> 00:00:22,129
(Amy:)Wow.

8
00:00:23,126 --> 00:00:24,856
(Official:)Penny?

9
00:00:24,927 --> 00:00:28,627
(Penny:)Right. Um... okay.

10
00:00:28,698 --> 00:00:30,628
(chuckles)

11
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:34,540
(Penny:)Leonard, I mean, you're not
only the love of my life.

12
00:00:34,603 --> 00:00:36,803
(Penny:)I mean,
you're my best friend, and...

13
00:00:38,907 --> 00:00:41,847
(Penny:)...you've got a friend in me.

14
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,550
(Penny:)You got troubles.

15
00:00:46,615 --> 00:00:48,415
(Penny:)I got 'em, too.

16
00:00:49,851 --> 00:00:53,591
(Penny:)There isn't anything
I wouldn't do for you.

17
00:00:53,656 --> 00:00:57,156
(Penny:)We stick together,
and we can see it through,

18
00:00:57,225 --> 00:01:02,025
(Penny:)'cause... you've got
a friend in me.

